{
  "dom_id": "step-t7791",
  "name": "Introduction",
  "problem": "**Measuring** means finding a number that describes the size of something. The most popular measurement system within the scientific community is the **metric system**. \n\nWe determine how much space an object occupies by measuring its **volume**. We use **volume units** to specify an object's volume. \n\nA common metric unit of volume is the **liter,** which we denote using the symbol \"$\\textrm{L}$.\" We can use **measuring jugs** like the ones below to measure the volume of a liquid.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14131635/assets/fa15e2d9b446412876732435aa06b8117fbb4903ab179e4cc64c50da4868fee7.png)\n\nWe use **milliliters** to measure smaller volumes. The symbol for milliliters is \"$\\textrm{mL}.$\" The prefix $\\textrm m$ stands for **milli,** which means $\\dfrac{1}{1\\,000}.$ Therefore, $1\\,\\textrm{mL}$ equals $\\dfrac{1}{1\\,000}\\,\\textrm L.$\n\nNotice that if we add $1\\,\\textrm{mL}$ to itself $1\\,000$ times, we get exactly $1\\,\\textrm{L}{:}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{1\\,000\\text{ times}}{\\overset{⏞}{1\\,\\text{mL}+1\\,\\text{mL}+⋯+1\\,\\text{mL}}} & = \\\\ \\frac{1}{1\\,000}\\,\\text{L}+\\frac{1}{1\\,000}\\,\\text{L}+⋯+\\frac{1}{1\\,000}\\,\\text{L} & = \\\\ 1\\,000\\times \\frac{1}{1\\,000}\\,\\text{L} & = \\\\ \\frac{1\\,000\\times 1}{1\\,000}\\,\\text{L} & = \\\\ \\frac{1\\,000}{1\\,000}\\,\\text{L} & = \\\\ 1\\,\\text{L}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $1\\,000\\,\\textrm{mL}$ equals $1\\,\\textrm{L},$ as stated in the diagram.",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-t7791\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\">\n    \n               \n                <div class=\"tutorial\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Introduction</span></div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"t7791\">?</div>\n                    </div>                    \n    \n                    <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p><strong>Measuring</strong> means finding a number that describes the size of something. The most popular measurement system within the scientific community is the <strong>metric system</strong>. </p>\n<p>We determine how much space an object occupies by measuring its <strong>volume</strong>. We use <strong>volume units</strong> to specify an object's volume. </p>\n<p>A common metric unit of volume is the <strong>liter,</strong> which we denote using the symbol \"<span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.453ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 625.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\\textrm{L}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-4C\" d=\"M128 622Q121 629 117 631T101 634T58 637H25V683H36Q48 680 182 680Q324 680 348 683H360V637H333Q273 637 258 635T233 622L232 342V129Q232 57 237 52Q243 47 313 47Q384 47 410 53Q470 70 498 110T536 221Q536 226 537 238T540 261T542 272T562 273H582V268Q580 265 568 137T554 5V0H25V46H58Q100 47 109 49T128 61V622Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-4C\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>.\" We can use <strong>measuring jugs</strong> like the ones below to measure the volume of a liquid.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-9ffa7779193f1821ae506b861979fdcf\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/9ffa7779193f1821ae506b861979fdcf\"></div>\n\n\n<p>We use <strong>milliliters</strong> to measure smaller volumes. The symbol for milliliters is \"<span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"4.035ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 1737.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\\textrm{mL}.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-6D\" d=\"M41 46H55Q94 46 102 60V68Q102 77 102 91T102 122T103 161T103 203Q103 234 103 269T102 328V351Q99 370 88 376T43 385H25V408Q25 431 27 431L37 432Q47 433 65 434T102 436Q119 437 138 438T167 441T178 442H181V402Q181 364 182 364T187 369T199 384T218 402T247 421T285 437Q305 442 336 442Q351 442 364 440T387 434T406 426T421 417T432 406T441 395T448 384T452 374T455 366L457 361L460 365Q463 369 466 373T475 384T488 397T503 410T523 422T546 432T572 439T603 442Q729 442 740 329Q741 322 741 190V104Q741 66 743 59T754 49Q775 46 803 46H819V0H811L788 1Q764 2 737 2T699 3Q596 3 587 0H579V46H595Q656 46 656 62Q657 64 657 200Q656 335 655 343Q649 371 635 385T611 402T585 404Q540 404 506 370Q479 343 472 315T464 232V168V108Q464 78 465 68T468 55T477 49Q498 46 526 46H542V0H534L510 1Q487 2 460 2T422 3Q319 3 310 0H302V46H318Q379 46 379 62Q380 64 380 200Q379 335 378 343Q372 371 358 385T334 402T308 404Q263 404 229 370Q202 343 195 315T187 232V168V108Q187 78 188 68T191 55T200 49Q221 46 249 46H265V0H257L234 1Q210 2 183 2T145 3Q42 3 33 0H25V46H41Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-4C\" d=\"M128 622Q121 629 117 631T101 634T58 637H25V683H36Q48 680 182 680Q324 680 348 683H360V637H333Q273 637 258 635T233 622L232 342V129Q232 57 237 52Q243 47 313 47Q384 47 410 53Q470 70 498 110T536 221Q536 226 537 238T540 261T542 272T562 273H582V268Q580 265 568 137T554 5V0H25V46H58Q100 47 109 49T128 61V622Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-6D\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-4C\" x=\"833\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"1459\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>\" The prefix <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.936ex\" height=\"1.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 833.5 721.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\\textrm m</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-6D\" d=\"M41 46H55Q94 46 102 60V68Q102 77 102 91T102 122T103 161T103 203Q103 234 103 269T102 328V351Q99 370 88 376T43 385H25V408Q25 431 27 431L37 432Q47 433 65 434T102 436Q119 437 138 438T167 441T178 442H181V402Q181 364 182 364T187 369T199 384T218 402T247 421T285 437Q305 442 336 442Q351 442 364 440T387 434T406 426T421 417T432 406T441 395T448 384T452 374T455 366L457 361L460 365Q463 369 466 373T475 384T488 397T503 410T523 422T546 432T572 439T603 442Q729 442 740 329Q741 322 741 190V104Q741 66 743 59T754 49Q775 46 803 46H819V0H811L788 1Q764 2 737 2T699 3Q596 3 587 0H579V46H595Q656 46 656 62Q657 64 657 200Q656 335 655 343Q649 371 635 385T611 402T585 404Q540 404 506 370Q479 343 472 315T464 232V168V108Q464 78 465 68T468 55T477 49Q498 46 526 46H542V0H534L510 1Q487 2 460 2T422 3Q319 3 310 0H302V46H318Q379 46 379 62Q380 64 380 200Q379 335 378 343Q372 371 358 385T334 402T308 404Q263 404 229 370Q202 343 195 315T187 232V168V108Q187 78 188 68T191 55T200 49Q221 46 249 46H265V0H257L234 1Q210 2 183 2T145 3Q42 3 33 0H25V46H41Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-6D\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> stands for <strong>milli,</strong> which means <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"6.52ex\" height=\"5.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1437.2 2807.2 2228.5\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\\dfrac{1}{1\\,000}.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-30\" d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"2288\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"894\" y=\"676\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,-687)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(667,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-30\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"1001\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"2528\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> Therefore, <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"4.938ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 2126.2 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">1\\,\\textrm{mL}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-6D\" d=\"M41 46H55Q94 46 102 60V68Q102 77 102 91T102 122T103 161T103 203Q103 234 103 269T102 328V351Q99 370 88 376T43 385H25V408Q25 431 27 431L37 432Q47 433 65 434T102 436Q119 437 138 438T167 441T178 442H181V402Q181 364 182 364T187 369T199 384T218 402T247 421T285 437Q305 442 336 442Q351 442 364 440T387 434T406 426T421 417T432 406T441 395T448 384T452 374T455 366L457 361L460 365Q463 369 466 373T475 384T488 397T503 410T523 422T546 432T572 439T603 442Q729 442 740 329Q741 322 741 190V104Q741 66 743 59T754 49Q775 46 803 46H819V0H811L788 1Q764 2 737 2T699 3Q596 3 587 0H579V46H595Q656 46 656 62Q657 64 657 200Q656 335 655 343Q649 371 635 385T611 402T585 404Q540 404 506 370Q479 343 472 315T464 232V168V108Q464 78 465 68T468 55T477 49Q498 46 526 46H542V0H534L510 1Q487 2 460 2T422 3Q319 3 310 0H302V46H318Q379 46 379 62Q380 64 380 200Q379 335 378 343Q372 371 358 385T334 402T308 404Q263 404 229 370Q202 343 195 315T187 232V168V108Q187 78 188 68T191 55T200 49Q221 46 249 46H265V0H257L234 1Q210 2 183 2T145 3Q42 3 33 0H25V46H41Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-4C\" d=\"M128 622Q121 629 117 631T101 634T58 637H25V683H36Q48 680 182 680Q324 680 348 683H360V637H333Q273 637 258 635T233 622L232 342V129Q232 57 237 52Q243 47 313 47Q384 47 410 53Q470 70 498 110T536 221Q536 226 537 238T540 261T542 272T562 273H582V268Q580 265 568 137T554 5V0H25V46H58Q100 47 109 49T128 61V622Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(667,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-6D\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-4C\" x=\"833\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span> equals <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"8.36ex\" height=\"5.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1437.2 3599.3 2228.5\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">\\dfrac{1}{1\\,000}\\,\\textrm L.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAIN-30\" d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAIN-4C\" d=\"M128 622Q121 629 117 631T101 634T58 637H25V683H36Q48 680 182 680Q324 680 348 683H360V637H333Q273 637 258 635T233 622L232 342V129Q232 57 237 52Q243 47 313 47Q384 47 410 53Q470 70 498 110T536 221Q536 226 537 238T540 261T542 272T562 273H582V268Q580 265 568 137T554 5V0H25V46H58Q100 47 109 49T128 61V622Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"2288\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"894\" y=\"676\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,-687)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(667,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-30\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"1001\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-4C\" x=\"2695\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"3320\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Notice that if we add <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"4.938ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 2126.2 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\">1\\,\\textrm{mL}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMAIN-6D\" d=\"M41 46H55Q94 46 102 60V68Q102 77 102 91T102 122T103 161T103 203Q103 234 103 269T102 328V351Q99 370 88 376T43 385H25V408Q25 431 27 431L37 432Q47 433 65 434T102 436Q119 437 138 438T167 441T178 442H181V402Q181 364 182 364T187 369T199 384T218 402T247 421T285 437Q305 442 336 442Q351 442 364 440T387 434T406 426T421 417T432 406T441 395T448 384T452 374T455 366L457 361L460 365Q463 369 466 373T475 384T488 397T503 410T523 422T546 432T572 439T603 442Q729 442 740 329Q741 322 741 190V104Q741 66 743 59T754 49Q775 46 803 46H819V0H811L788 1Q764 2 737 2T699 3Q596 3 587 0H579V46H595Q656 46 656 62Q657 64 657 200Q656 335 655 343Q649 371 635 385T611 402T585 404Q540 404 506 370Q479 343 472 315T464 232V168V108Q464 78 465 68T468 55T477 49Q498 46 526 46H542V0H534L510 1Q487 2 460 2T422 3Q319 3 310 0H302V46H318Q379 46 379 62Q380 64 380 200Q379 335 378 343Q372 371 358 385T334 402T308 404Q263 404 229 370Q202 343 195 315T187 232V168V108Q187 78 188 68T191 55T200 49Q221 46 249 46H265V0H257L234 1Q210 2 183 2T145 3Q42 3 33 0H25V46H41Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMAIN-4C\" d=\"M128 622Q121 629 117 631T101 634T58 637H25V683H36Q48 680 182 680Q324 680 348 683H360V637H333Q273 637 258 635T